{
  "id": "immigration",
  "name": "Religious Immigration",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note",
      "type": "Comment",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -90,
      "params": {
        "text": "Religious immigration (spec/systems/immigration.md), rebuilt with Formula + TableLookup. Trigger: the accumulated crosses (power0.crosses) pass the byte-verified crosses_threshold -- base a = total colonists + units, then min(a*2+8, 4000), scaled by difficulty (8-diff)/8 and England x2/3; the spawn fires when crosses STRICTLY exceed it (jg). Arriving class = difficulty-weighted refill roll: roll(1,15) <= (diff+18)/2 picks a low tier (criminals/servants/farmers, @CLASS rows 0-2) else high tier (Trained Mercenaries 6, or Educated Elite 7 with William Brewster ff.20). Class name + recruit cost read live from @CLASS by index."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "trig",
      "type": "OnTurnStart",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 40,
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "gate",
      "type": "Formula",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 150,
      "params": {
        "expr": "power0.crosses > min((colonies.population + power0.units)*2 + 8, 4000)*(8-game.difficulty)/8*2/3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "br",
      "type": "Branch",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 40,
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "cls",
      "type": "Formula",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 260,
      "params": {
        "expr": "roll(1,15) <= (game.difficulty+18)/2 ? roll(0,2) : (ff.20 ? 7 : 6)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "name",
      "type": "TableLookup",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 260,
      "params": {
        "section": "@CLASS",
        "column": "name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cost",
      "type": "TableLookup",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 330,
      "params": {
        "section": "@CLASS",
        "column": "transport_cost"
      }
    },
    {
